Common RatingLevel
    documentation "The descriptive level(s) of ratings (cut scores) for evaluation."
    descriptor EvaluationRatingLevel
        documentation "The title for a level of rating or evaluation band (e.g., Excellent, Acceptable, Needs Improvement, Unacceptable)."
        is part of identity
        is required
    shared decimal Value
        documentation "The minimum numerical rating or score to achieve the evaluation rating level."
        is optional
        role name Min
    shared decimal Value 
        documentation "The maximum numerical rating or score to achieve the evaluation rating level."
        is optional
        role name Max